 TL;DR Cracked_Block is a crypto challenge from WMS. Name: Cracked Block Value: 0 Description: Four encrypted messages were successfully intercepted from the Phantom Collective&rsquo;s internal communications. One of the messages turned out to be an announcement that had been published on their portal — we have the plaintext. Name: Cracked Block Value: 0 Description: Four encrypted messages were successfully intercepted from the Phantom Collective&rsquo;s internal communications. One of the messages turned out to be an announcement that had been published on their portal — we have the plaintext.
Analyze all four messages carefully. There are weaknesses in the way they use encryption.
Files: intercepted_messages.json, published_announcement.json Format flags: WMS{&hellip;}

 TL;DR Pad_Room is a crypto challenge from WMS. Name: Pad Space Value: 0 Description: Phantom Session Management Service uses AES-CBC to encrypt session cookies. Cookies contain JSON data including user roles. Name: Bearing Room Value: 0 Description: Phantom Session Management Service uses AES-CBC to encrypt session cookies. Cookies contain JSON data including user roles.
You can log in as an operator, but need admin access to read confidential documents. The server responds differently for valid vs invalid padding.
