 TL;DR Quantum_Seal is a crypto challenge from WMS. Name: Quantum Seal Value: 0 Description: The SIGINT team successfully intercepted an encrypted communication transcript between two Phantom Collective nodes. They use a custom key exchange protocol called PhantomKEM which is claimed to be &ldquo;quantum-safe&rdquo;. Name: Quantum Seal Value: 0 Description: The SIGINT team successfully intercepted transcripts of encrypted communications between two Phantom Collective nodes. They use a custom key exchange protocol called PhantomKEM which is claimed to be &ldquo;quantum-safe&rdquo;.
Analyze protocol transcripts, understand how their key exchanges work, and find weaknesses.
File: intercepted_transcript.txt Flags format: WMS{&hellip;}

 TL;DR Time_Is_Key is a crypto challenge from WMS. Name: Time Is the Key Value: 0 Description: Phantom Collective&rsquo;s KeyServer uses RSA to encrypt confidential documents. From network interception, we get the public key and ciphertext. Name: Timing Is Key Value: 0 Description: Phantom Collective&rsquo;s KeyServer uses RSA to encrypt confidential documents. From network interception, we get the public key and ciphertext.
